WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:33.006 --> 00:01:37.244
Sasami... With you here,
I don't need anything else.

00:01:37.244 --> 00:01:42.182
Not a city or people or the
ocean or the sky or the stars.

00:01:42.182 --> 00:01:49.782
Come, let's create a world
together for just the two of us.

00:01:55.328 --> 00:01:58.265
I can't ask for help! I can't ask them for help!

00:01:58.265 --> 00:02:02.803
I fell into Yugi's trap and split everyone up!

00:02:02.803 --> 00:02:04.964
I can't ask them to help me!

00:02:42.342 --> 00:02:43.934
Tenchi...

00:02:56.923 --> 00:02:58.754
Yugi!

00:03:00.794 --> 00:03:05.799
What, are you surprised at us
babes appearing out of nowhere?

00:03:05.799 --> 00:03:07.234
Yugi...

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:11.204
Yugi, you can see for yourself.
The Tenchi Family is together again!

00:03:11.204 --> 00:03:13.640
Admittedly, we have
these gems to thank for it...

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:15.609
Really?

00:03:15.609 --> 00:03:19.179
You split us up, weakened the
Earth's power to defend itself,

00:03:19.179 --> 00:03:20.680
and created your own country.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:25.318
You put a lot of work into it, but you lose!

00:03:25.318 --> 00:03:28.388
That little girl came up with all that?

00:03:28.388 --> 00:03:31.258
What, are you too scared to talk?

00:03:31.258 --> 00:03:34.694
Come on, say something!

00:03:35.529 --> 00:03:38.031
Why?

00:03:38.031 --> 00:03:41.801
Why did you leave me, Sasami?

00:03:41.801 --> 00:03:47.674
That's so mean... I like you
so much, Sasami, so why?

00:03:47.674 --> 00:03:49.943
What's she babbling about?

00:03:49.943 --> 00:03:52.112
Please... Come back.

00:03:52.112 --> 00:03:54.114
What nonsense!

00:03:54.114 --> 00:03:58.118
As if I'd hand over my dear
little sister to a villain like you!

00:03:58.118 --> 00:04:03.223
I'll give you anything.
I'll do anything for you, Sasami!

00:04:03.223 --> 00:04:06.993
Please! Please!

00:04:06.993 --> 00:04:11.396
I was happy... I was happy when
you gave me that music box, Yugi.

00:04:12.933 --> 00:04:15.299
Do you want this?

00:04:17.837 --> 00:04:20.140
Thanks!

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:25.078
That's why I couldn't believe
that you were a bad person, Yugi.

00:04:25.078 --> 00:04:28.481
I didn't want to believe it.

00:04:28.481 --> 00:04:30.717
I'll give you all the music boxes you want!

00:04:30.717 --> 00:04:33.820
No, I'll give you the whole world, Sasami!

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:39.492
No! That's not the point! Stop doing this, Yugi!

00:04:39.492 --> 00:04:43.129
No! I'm going to make a
world for you and me, Sasami!

00:04:43.129 --> 00:04:47.467
What're you saying, Yugi?!
That's wrong! It's wrong!

00:04:47.467 --> 00:04:51.771
Stop doing this! Be friends
with everybody, not just me!

00:04:51.771 --> 00:04:54.441
Sasami, come here. Hurry!

00:04:54.441 --> 00:04:56.966
I'll spare just you.

00:04:59.846 --> 00:05:02.482
Come to me, Sasami.

00:05:02.482 --> 00:05:04.882
What's wrong, Sasami?

00:05:06.186 --> 00:05:07.847
Sasami!

00:05:10.056 --> 00:05:13.460
I'm begging you! Please stop this, Yugi!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:16.691
What's the point of all this?

00:05:17.964 --> 00:05:21.422
I... Yugi, I...

00:05:24.437 --> 00:05:27.941
I'll hate you, Yugi!

00:05:27.941 --> 00:05:33.680
Foolish child... Let's finish them off.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.515
Yugi?

00:05:35.515 --> 00:05:39.178
Shut up! You go away, too!

00:05:41.888 --> 00:05:43.623
Sasami!

00:05:43.623 --> 00:05:50.495
Sasami, I hated you all along.
Disappear, all of you!

00:05:50.964 --> 00:05:53.592
All of you, cease to exist!

00:06:03.043 --> 00:06:05.978
Tenchi! Tenchi!

00:06:08.415 --> 00:06:09.449
Everybody?

00:06:09.449 --> 00:06:11.618
We're okay! We're all okay!

00:06:11.618 --> 00:06:13.453
Now you've gone and done it...

00:06:13.453 --> 00:06:16.081
This is Yugi's country, after all.

00:06:22.862 --> 00:06:24.631
What an evil world...

00:06:24.631 --> 00:06:27.429
Is this Yugi's real self?

00:06:29.969 --> 00:06:31.638
That little pipsqueak!

00:06:31.638 --> 00:06:36.810
If I don't pay her back for using
us like toys, I'll never live it down!

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:38.545
Wait, Ryoko!

00:06:38.545 --> 00:06:39.913
Tenchi?

00:06:39.913 --> 00:06:44.584
I know I don't have the
right to ask you to do anything,

00:06:44.584 --> 00:06:47.587
but I want to see Yugi alone.

00:06:47.587 --> 00:06:49.656
This is all my fault.

00:06:49.656 --> 00:06:52.826
I was the one who fell for her plans.

00:06:52.826 --> 00:06:54.894
So I want to put an end to this.

00:06:54.894 --> 00:06:57.697
- Tenchi...
- Tenchi...

00:06:57.697 --> 00:06:59.099
That's crazy!

00:06:59.099 --> 00:07:04.204
Yugi's a mutant who brought
Jurai to the brink of destruction!

00:07:04.204 --> 00:07:07.240
She's not an opponent
you can handle bare-handed.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:10.710
Guys, will you give me back your gems?

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:12.644
Lord Tenchi...

00:07:17.484 --> 00:07:21.477
You're gonna use that power?

00:07:22.422 --> 00:07:26.459
Why not? Looks like I'll be
able to see these gems' real power.

00:07:26.459 --> 00:07:28.586
C'mon, everybody! Hand 'em over!

00:07:31.331 --> 00:07:35.702
- Tenchi.
- Tenchi.

00:07:35.702 --> 00:07:38.805
Way to go! That's the
manly thing to do, Tenchi!

00:07:38.805 --> 00:07:42.008
I'll let you do it. Go to it!

00:07:42.008 --> 00:07:46.206
Just a moment, Ryoko.
Don't say such irresponsible things.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:52.719
Tenchi, I made up my mind three
seconds ago to do anything you ask.

00:07:52.719 --> 00:07:55.916
Take this with you. Think of it as me.

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:00.426
Lord Tenchi, please don't take any risks.

00:08:00.426 --> 00:08:02.155
I'll be okay.

00:08:03.062 --> 00:08:04.697
Lord Tenchi!

00:08:04.697 --> 00:08:06.132
Tenchi...

00:08:06.132 --> 00:08:12.672
Yugi... She's really...
I mean, she was my friend.

00:08:12.672 --> 00:08:15.038
So... So, please...

00:08:38.231 --> 00:08:42.435
That's so cool! That's how a man's gotta be!

00:08:42.435 --> 00:08:45.238
I've fallen in love all over again, Tenchi!

00:08:45.238 --> 00:08:47.440
Lord Tenchi...

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:49.542
Ryoko? Where are you going?

00:08:49.542 --> 00:08:52.545
Where else? I'm going with Tenchi.

00:08:52.545 --> 00:08:55.014
But Lord Tenchi wants to do it himself...

00:08:55.014 --> 00:08:57.417
I just figured it out.

00:08:57.417 --> 00:09:00.820
I always have the most
fun when I'm with Tenchi.

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:02.822
Nobody else does it for me.

00:09:02.822 --> 00:09:06.593
Admittedly, I don't know how he feels...

00:09:06.593 --> 00:09:10.196
So I'm gonna go with him.
You think that's funny?

00:09:10.196 --> 00:09:13.666
Ryoko, I won't let you
slip away on your own.

00:09:13.666 --> 00:09:15.301
Mihoshi, we're going, too!

00:09:15.301 --> 00:09:16.768
Right!

00:09:24.577 --> 00:09:27.447
Stay away! Don't come any closer!

00:09:27.447 --> 00:09:29.438
Stay away from me!

00:09:38.925 --> 00:09:39.692
Ryoko?

00:09:39.692 --> 00:09:41.928
Hey, don't worry about the small stuff today!

00:09:41.928 --> 00:09:43.657
Go on ahead!

00:09:46.466 --> 00:09:48.101
Kiyone? Mihoshi?

00:09:48.101 --> 00:09:49.235
We'll cover you.

00:09:49.235 --> 00:09:52.538
I won't screw up like I usually do today!

00:09:52.538 --> 00:09:54.440
Lord Tenchi!

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:56.476
This way! Hurry!

00:09:56.476 --> 00:09:59.312
The path is closing!

00:09:59.312 --> 00:10:00.146
Got it!

00:10:00.146 --> 00:10:02.215
I can't do anything to help...

00:10:02.215 --> 00:10:05.251
That's okay, that's okay.
Everybody helps in their own way.

00:10:05.251 --> 00:10:06.619
It's disappearing!

00:10:06.619 --> 00:10:08.788
Yugi, what are you doing?

00:10:08.788 --> 00:10:11.457
She's trying to shut
herself up in her own world.

00:10:11.457 --> 00:10:13.393
That's what they need to stop first.

00:10:13.393 --> 00:10:15.328
Go for it, Tenchi!

00:10:15.328 --> 00:10:16.896
That's when the real problem starts.

00:10:16.896 --> 00:10:20.093
What're you planning to do
once you reach Yugi, Tenchi?

00:10:22.035 --> 00:10:24.637
Tenchi might not fight her?!

00:10:24.637 --> 00:10:28.508
But Tenchi and the Masaki clan
are the Planetary Defenders, right?

00:10:28.508 --> 00:10:30.143
So why wouldn't he?!

00:10:30.143 --> 00:10:32.612
Because Tenchi's a kindhearted boy.

00:10:32.612 --> 00:10:34.580
He doesn't like fighting.

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:39.118
Still, he's defended this world
just fine so far in spite of that.

00:10:39.118 --> 00:10:40.787
"So far"?

00:10:40.787 --> 00:10:45.124
Washu, have you ever given any
thought to why six alien ladies...

00:10:45.124 --> 00:10:51.564
...are living in a little shrine in Okayama?

00:10:51.564 --> 00:10:54.267
I suppose it's no simple coincidence.

00:10:54.267 --> 00:10:59.072
Which means that our being
drawn here was Tenchi's doing.

00:10:59.072 --> 00:11:02.875
He keeps those would harm
the planet close to himself

00:11:02.875 --> 00:11:06.980
and lives with them in peace to
prevent them from running rampant.

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:12.051
Tenchi is fulfilling his duty
as Defender without fighting.

00:11:12.051 --> 00:11:13.753
Ah, I see. So that's what happened.

00:11:13.753 --> 00:11:17.290
Oh, perhaps " those who would
harm the planet" was going too far...

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:21.995
No, we're all folks who would
destroy a planet or two if we got mad.

00:11:21.995 --> 00:11:24.293
Myself included.

00:11:25.231 --> 00:11:30.737
It is our duty to fight to protect this world.

00:11:30.737 --> 00:11:35.074
Pulling someone's fangs and cleansing
their heart, all without fighting...

00:11:35.074 --> 00:11:36.943
Tenchi's something else, isn't he?

00:11:36.943 --> 00:11:39.779
Of course, he's unaware of what he does.

00:11:39.779 --> 00:11:42.339
That might prove to be a weak spot.

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:45.785
Can you do it, Tenchi?

00:11:45.785 --> 00:11:49.380
You may have to turn that sword on Yugi.

00:11:57.697 --> 00:12:02.191
Will you fight, Tenchi? Or will you?

00:12:27.393 --> 00:12:31.853
Stay away! Don't come any closer!

00:12:52.819 --> 00:12:54.687
There's no end to these things, Kiyone!

00:12:54.687 --> 00:12:56.222
Hurry, Tenchi!

00:12:56.222 --> 00:12:59.191
Sorry, Kiyone, Mihoshi!

00:12:59.892 --> 00:13:03.328
Tenchi, I see it! There's the entrance!

00:13:10.002 --> 00:13:12.163
Stay away!

00:13:20.079 --> 00:13:21.013
Yugi!

00:13:21.013 --> 00:13:22.776
Leave it to me!

00:13:27.286 --> 00:13:28.776
Ryoko!

00:13:30.156 --> 00:13:34.024
Don't underestimate Ryoko!

00:13:39.899 --> 00:13:42.502
Ryoko! Are you okay?!

00:13:42.502 --> 00:13:46.572
Of course. Okay, Tenchi, get going.

00:13:46.572 --> 00:13:49.473
You want to settle up
with her personally, right?

00:13:59.051 --> 00:14:01.019
Lord Tenchi...

00:14:09.662 --> 00:14:11.789
Yugi!

00:14:18.671 --> 00:14:20.973
Are you going to seal me away again?

00:14:20.973 --> 00:14:25.144
No! Don't! What have I done wrong?!

00:14:25.144 --> 00:14:28.047
Don't! Please, don't!

00:14:28.047 --> 00:14:33.419
I'm... I'm sick of being alone!

00:14:33.419 --> 00:14:35.254
Stop it, Yugi!

00:14:35.254 --> 00:14:37.745
I'm lonely!

00:14:45.631 --> 00:14:47.462
Tenchi!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.375
Stay away... Stay away!

00:14:56.375 --> 00:14:58.044
Stay away! Stay away!

00:14:58.044 --> 00:15:01.309
Stay away! Stay away! Stay away!

00:15:12.391 --> 00:15:17.658
You really shouldn't be doing this,
no matter how lonely you are.

00:15:19.298 --> 00:15:22.335
What makes you think that you're alone?

00:15:22.335 --> 00:15:28.638
If you're lonely and want friends,
you should've come to our place.

00:15:30.209 --> 00:15:37.917
I was lonely... I was scared...
I've always been alone.

00:15:37.917 --> 00:15:44.413
That's why I want to be with
Sasami... I'm sick of being alone.

00:15:52.531 --> 00:15:58.371
Come to our place. You can
think of it as your own home.

00:15:58.371 --> 00:16:00.006
Tenchi!

00:16:00.006 --> 00:16:02.975
Tenchi, you...

00:16:02.975 --> 00:16:05.170
I'm sleepy...

00:16:08.714 --> 00:16:13.085
I'm sleepy... So tired...

00:16:13.085 --> 00:16:15.280
I'm not surprised.

00:16:21.861 --> 00:16:25.820
Hey! It's morning already!

00:16:27.566 --> 00:16:30.803
"Masaki, how's it going?

00:16:30.803 --> 00:16:33.873
When you went back to Okayama
all of a sudden over summer vacation,

00:16:33.873 --> 00:16:37.710
you really surprised Amagasaki,
Kanno, and the others.

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:42.548
It was only one semester,
but it was pretty fun, huh?

00:16:42.548 --> 00:16:47.645
If you're ever in Tokyo again,
you'd better drop by the shrine."

00:16:48.287 --> 00:16:48.754
"From the Girls in Tokyo"

00:16:48.754 --> 00:16:51.223
"From the Girls in Tokyo"
Those guys and their dumb jokes...

00:16:51.223 --> 00:16:51.689
Those guys and their dumb jokes...

00:16:52.725 --> 00:16:55.227
I said I won't talk, so I won't talk!

00:16:55.227 --> 00:17:00.800
A-As a father, I can't talk
about my son's private life!

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:04.503
No, I can't talk about it as a human!
Don't you understand that?!

00:17:04.503 --> 00:17:07.540
Damn it! Don't mess with me!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.609
Look me in the eyes and say that!

00:17:10.609 --> 00:17:15.181
Stop it, you two! It doesn't
matter who the letter was from!

00:17:15.181 --> 00:17:17.883
But I think you should tell us, too!

00:17:17.883 --> 00:17:18.818
I mean...

00:17:18.818 --> 00:17:21.787
My anger's reaching the boiling point!

00:17:23.222 --> 00:17:24.790
Look, keep it under your hats, but...

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.459
Look me in the eyes!

00:17:26.459 --> 00:17:29.295
The sender on the envelope read...

00:17:29.295 --> 00:17:31.923
It read, "From the Girls in Tokyo"!

00:17:37.603 --> 00:17:40.773
Mihoshi! Kiyone! You came to rescue me!

00:17:40.773 --> 00:17:42.341
Thank you so much!

00:17:42.341 --> 00:17:44.810
We're crashing!

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:47.446
It hasn't been serviced properly!

00:17:47.446 --> 00:17:48.647
What?!

00:17:48.647 --> 00:17:49.982
Lord Tenchi!

00:17:49.982 --> 00:17:50.783
- Tenchi! Tenchi!

00:17:50.783 --> 00:17:54.754
- Just how many women were
you associating with in Tokyo?!
- Tenchi! Tenchi!

00:17:54.754 --> 00:17:57.882
- Lord Tenchi!
- Tenchi!

00:18:07.099 --> 00:18:10.669
And you can imagine that
things were pretty crazy today.

00:18:10.669 --> 00:18:12.505
But it's fun around here every day!

00:18:12.505 --> 00:18:15.574
Because I really like everybody!

00:18:15.574 --> 00:18:23.416
If we meet again someday when
I'm big, I bet we'll have more fun.

00:18:23.416 --> 00:18:26.986
Anyway, that's what it was
like today. Good night, Yugi.

00:18:26.986 --> 00:18:28.783
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:18:32.858 --> 00:18:35.088
Come on, Ryo-Ohki, let's go get dinner ready!

00:18:37.129 --> 00:18:38.831
We've been through a lot, huh?

00:18:38.831 --> 00:18:40.299
Yeah.

00:18:40.299 --> 00:18:42.802
You really pulled through.

00:18:42.802 --> 00:18:45.304
Did we really do the right thing?

00:18:45.304 --> 00:18:47.239
You don't think so?

00:18:47.239 --> 00:18:49.942
I wonder...

00:18:49.942 --> 00:18:54.213
At any rate, she can't stay in
this world for long the way she is.

00:18:54.213 --> 00:18:57.650
But Washu could've
come up with something...

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.618
It's what she wanted.

00:18:59.618 --> 00:19:03.823
She said she'll sleep until she
grows up and becomes a good person.

00:19:03.823 --> 00:19:08.794
Say, Tenchi... That "Sakuya"
girl was Yugi's reflection, right?

00:19:08.794 --> 00:19:13.732
That means that when Yugi
grows up, she might turn into Sakuya.

00:19:13.732 --> 00:19:16.535
If that happens, what'll you do, Tenchi?

00:19:16.535 --> 00:19:18.332
What do you mean?

00:19:21.173 --> 00:19:23.776
This puppy love is no match for me!

00:19:23.776 --> 00:19:26.412
Forgiving her man's wandering
eye is part of a woman's nobility!

00:19:26.412 --> 00:19:29.548
I mean, I am a grown-up woman.

00:19:29.548 --> 00:19:31.675
A grown-up woman, huh?

00:19:34.153 --> 00:19:36.322
I lied. I won't forgive you!

00:19:36.322 --> 00:19:40.520
Kiss me, too, and then I'll forgive you!

00:19:41.827 --> 00:19:43.954
I don't do it for you?

00:19:50.402 --> 00:19:52.104
Oh, this is where it comes out!

00:19:52.104 --> 00:19:56.008
I used those gems to
make a new Dimension Tunnel!

00:19:56.008 --> 00:19:56.675
Bye!

00:19:56.675 --> 00:20:00.646
Hold it right there!
Do you realize what you just did?!

00:20:00.646 --> 00:20:03.482
I made a Dimension Tunnel.

00:20:03.482 --> 00:20:06.085
Dinner's getting cold!

00:20:06.085 --> 00:20:07.920
Lord Tenchi!

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:10.089
Ryoko! Stop that violent behavior at once!

00:20:10.089 --> 00:20:12.591
No way! I'll make her pay!

00:20:12.591 --> 00:20:15.227
I'm sorry, we can't chip in
for the food bill this month.

00:20:15.227 --> 00:20:18.390
Please let us have dinner!

00:20:30.809 --> 00:20:33.379
I wonder how Masaki's doing?

00:20:33.379 --> 00:20:36.615
Sounds like he's doing fine.

00:20:36.615 --> 00:20:38.717
Maybe we should write another letter.

00:20:38.717 --> 00:20:40.052
Yeah, maybe.

00:20:40.052 --> 00:20:41.053
What should we do?

00:20:41.053 --> 00:20:44.156
Let's write a letter to Masaki, too, you guys!

00:20:44.156 --> 00:20:46.147
- Good idea!
- Yeah, let's do it!

00:21:00.072 --> 00:21:01.407
